  "details": "On certain avatars, going upsidedown while using \"Lock-all\" with a chest tracker will cause the neck to flip and rotate around uncontrollably for remote players. \n- it doesn't really happen locally (it can happen, but like a single flip instead of the head going insane)\n- it only happens in lock all mode with the chest tracker. Don't happen otherwise\n- it affects only some avatars (possibly related to the setup of the neck in the armature?)\n- the neck of the avatar with the issue seems to like to tilt forwards in lock-all mode\nI put a bunch of videos under difference scenarios in a public folder here: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aHaEAph-F7_QnbwhAshHjdUY5D7Jw4pE?usp=sharing\nIf not specified in the video title, the setup in the video is 9 point tracking (all but knees) and lock all.\nThe issue has been around since the chest tracker was added and as of the latest IK beta (11948) still occurs.",
